        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Rathaus"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Schultz Severin Hawthorn, where have you been?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "How are we supposed to get anything done in a strategic planning session without you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Was I here when you decided my son's fate?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Well... Tatjana should already have..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Yes, she told me. You had her tell me. I'm only reminding you what you've done."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "What's the situation?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "The Infected are still protesting. They've even started chasing off Infected newcomers."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "What do they want?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "They... they believe the fire was part of some kind of plot. They demand an explanation for Dr. Atro and the dead Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "A plot? An explanation? Great, someone must be riling them up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Even the Infected wouldn't stoop that low. Most of them are from Wolumonde."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Have they had any contact with that militant group out there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "None, for now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "But the militants have been lingering around the outskirts of the hamlet. I'm worried they might influence the protestors."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Just a second, it's from the sentry\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Two? Infected?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "They claim to be from Rhodes Island? I know that name\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "That would be Dr. Atro's company. *Sigh.* We knew this was coming."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Wh-what do we do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Dr. Atro was a respectable Infected. They may be here looking for her. And they have a right to know the truth."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Let them in."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "...You heard him. Do as he says."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Hmm, are you sure about this? What if they have something to do with the militants out there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Between the Great Rift, the fire, and the Infected, do we have the luxury to be suspicious of everyone who knocks on our door?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "What about after they learn the truth? What if Rhodes Island seeks reparations from us? How much is Wolumonde to suffer?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "...So what should we do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Lock our doors and send them away? Lie to them? Tell them Dr. Atro took some Oripathy patients out on a hike?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "I know we can't sweep it under the rug. But you don't have the final say in this. We have to prepare for the worst."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "No one has the final say on the truth, but... Never mind. Do as you will."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I'm leaving."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Leaving? Where are you going this time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "...I have a problem to solve."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "My only job is to get this town back on track. The decision-making process? I have little patience for your political games."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Hey! Wait!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "I know you're suffering, and there's so much we could've done better, but we had no choice!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I understand. That's why I'm still talking to you nice and peacefully."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I'll leave Rhodes Island to you. You're good at these things. I'll walk the blocks."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "That's the deal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Severin! Severin Hawthorn! You are this town's Schultz! You can't be running all over the\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Ugh! Must he always..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Sigh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Forget it. Tatjana, Severin, Thor. They're all tragic figures, really."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Councilor",
        "text": "Let's get this place cleaned up. Rhodes Island will be here soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
