    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Wolumonde. Its name means 'The Eighth Moon,' and together with seven other nearby towns, it makes up Leithanien's flourishing northern trade network\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "That's what the book said, anyway."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "From what I'm seeing, 'flourishing trade' isn't exactly how I'd describe it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Could it be because of the 'Great Rift' thing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Yes. A Catastrophe of that scale is rare. It could be more than a thousand meters deep, with exposed active Originium on the cliffsides. I shudder just thinking about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "But, Miss Folinic... You were very curious what would happen if you lobbed a shell into it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Nay, that was just my academic curiosity speaking. Realistically, one wrong move and the entire plateau could get cleaved in half."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Considering the detour we had to take, looks like this town won't be moving an inch."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "image"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_ltstreet1",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Visitors at a time like this? And such strange clothes. I hope this isn't an ill omen..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Look at her tails. Oh, and the crystals on her shoulder! Is she Infected?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "But those clothes look familiar... Where have I seen them before...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "M-Miss Folinic, can we really just walk down the street like this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "The prevalence of Originium Arts in Leithanien have brought two major benefits: first, the incredible music scene, and second, a broad tolerance of the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "There may be restrictions on your personal freedom, but should you want to live, you can win back that right as long as you're willing to pay the price."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "...Price?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "At least it's something affordable."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Wolumonde may be in the boonies and have its fair share of problems, but at least the Infected have a place to live... That's what she told me anyway\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "\u2014Oh, someone's coming."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "...Hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "(Hm? That man's uniform...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "(Is he with the Wolumonde Gendarmerie? Should we ask for directions?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "(He's coming toward us. Is this the welcoming committee?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "(I'm not sure...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "(Oh, he lit a cigarette.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "(He put his lighter into his pocket. Now he's holding the cigarette with his other hand. He switched hands again\u2014)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "(\u2014He walked away without looking back! Miss Folinic!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Excuse me\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Hello, we're\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Ah, Rhodes Island, I take it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "The Rathaus is just up ahead, right in front of the tallest tower. You see it? Good. Someone will meet you there."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Er, thanks. Can I ask your name...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Me? I'm off duty."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Um, what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I'm off duty. And I really don't want to talk so much when I'm off... I have my own business to deal with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "That's the deal. Later."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "And he's gone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "He was kind of rude, but I think he's been through a lot..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Hah... as if we're not tired!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "But at least he told us where to go. Let's go talk to the local\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Schultz! There you are!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "The Infected are protesting again. The Gendarmerie are already on the scene, but they need you there leading them\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Ah! You're smoking! Did the shopkeepers get to you again? Please, you have an image to maintain. You wouldn't want to lose the trust of the people\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Hm? What is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "...That's a... Schultz? A 'Schulthei\u00df' is like a local leader?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Is something wrong, Schultz?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "No. You're always working so hard, Tatjana. I admire you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Do you? Thank you\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Now, about those two, they're not from around here, are they? Could they be the doctors from Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Oh? Well, yes. We are indeed. I am Folinic and this is Suzuran."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "(Doctors?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "(I think we count.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "(Even me?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "(I'm a fully-fledged operator assigned to the Medical Department. And Lisa, you've... studied with Dr. Kal'tsit, so we can call you a medical intern. I guess.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I see... Oh! You two must be on your way to the Rathaus? I'm so sorry to get in your way!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Of course it should be the Schultz who receives you, but he really is needed at Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse... Er..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Oh, really, he can\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Ahem! Very good, Tatjana, you take them. I'll go look into this Infected situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "You two."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "\u2014Yes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I know why you're here. But our situation is dire."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Do you know what happened to Wolumonde?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "The Great Rift."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Yes. I get to skip over so much when dealing with smart people."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "So now the Infected are more riled up than ever before. If you don't want to get mixed up in that, stay away from Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "We are experts at dealing with the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I know. We had a Dr. Atro from your company working closely with us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "So you know we can help."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "We don't need it yet. It wouldn't be right to drag our guests into this mess as soon as they've arrived. That would get us into trouble too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "...So what is Atro doing here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "She's not here right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "So where is she?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "She..."
    },
